  "label": "Common meme structure using text overlays to create humor",
  "description": "The meme follows a common format where a visual image is paired with text overlays to create a humorous or ironic statement. The text 'power of christ does not compel this kitty' is a direct reference to the phrase 'power of Christ does not compel me,' which is often used in a sarcastic or defiant tone to express personal autonomy or resistance to authority. The meme adapts this phrase to a cat, creating a humorous and absurd scenario.",
